  "goodToKnow": "Das Erachten survives mainly in the formal phrase meines Erachtens (in my opinion), abbreviated m. E., common in academic papers, legal opinions and business emails. Also: unseres Erachtens. The verb erachten als or für means to consider: Ich erachte das für notwendig. In speech, people say meiner Meinung nach or ich finde. From achten (to respect, pay attention)."
